The lines of the bridge that come from positions rather than from flows, in USD over the window.
 is price moves in each holding's own currency, converted at the opening rate;
 the base-currency effect of rate moves ();
 the re-pricing of non-market assets (a fund unit price, a manual value);
 and  the value of accounts linked or
unlinked during the window, at their link or unlink date, both as positive amounts.

